<title>TURKEY: Turkish Petkim to tender for chemicals.</title>
<headline>Turkish Petkim to tender for chemicals.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish petrochemical producer Petkim invited bids for its purchases of 50,000 tonnes of VCM chemical and 2,400 tonnes of acetic acid, tender announcements in the local press said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company wil collect bids for VCM imports by January 7, and acetic acid by January 9, according to the announcement.</p>
<p>It did not give further details.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
